OL,3,GNEWSAWeekend of free interactive events
OL,4,Aacross Lancashire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA weekend of creativity is taking place
OL,7,Facross libraries in Lancashire, as well
OL,8,Fas Lancaster Castle and Judges'
OL,9,FLodgings, as part of the annual 'Fun
OL,10,FPalaces' initiative.
OL,12,FThe scheme started in 2014, in honour
OL,13,Fof theatre director Joan Littlewood,
OL,14,Fwho developed the original Fun Palace
OL,15,Fconcept, which sought to make arts and
OL,16,Fsciences accessible to everyone via
OL,17,Fcommunity-led activities
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
