OL,3,GNEWSAWeekend of free interactive events
OL,4,Aacross Lancashire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo celebrate her vision, a weekend of
OL,7,Ffamily-friendly activities will take
OL,8,Fplace from 2 4 October, with
OL,9,Fparticipating venues hosting a range of
OL,10,Fhands-on sessions including
OL,11,Fslime-making, family yoga, sensory play
OL,12,Fand Lego activities.
OL,14,FThe county council said more than 5,000
OL,15,Fpeople had attended free events last
OL,16,Fyear.
